00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:05.240
[? info ?] of your liking.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:05.740
MARK MANDEL: Oh, cool.

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:07.900
JON FOUST: So this means
that you can do every six

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:09.250
