VM on Google Cloud."

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:04.660
MARK MANDEL: Oh, cool.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.130
JON FOUST: What that actually
does for you is, like,

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:08.730
suppose that you have a VM
that's been running for a while

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:09.730
